  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thank you, Grant. You're verified, and I've looked into order Q-8201 from Big Slice Pizza.\n\nOur records show the courier picked up the order at 6:05 PM, then reported a vehicle breakdown at 6:40 PM. The app marked the order delivered at 6:52 PM automatically, but no handoff was ever recorded, so the food never reached your door. I'm sorry about that, and about the dinner mix-up.\n\nI've refunded the full $87.55 to your Visa ending in 4242. It should appear within 3 to 5 business days.\n\nIs there anything else I can help you with tonight?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, good. At least the money's coming back. But my kids are still hungry and the app just said it was delivered when it clearly wasn't, so that's not great. Is there anything you can do for us for the trouble, like a credit on the account for next time?"
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I understand, and I'm sorry the app showed the order as delivered when it wasn't.\n\nUnfortunately, I can't add a credit for the trouble. Our policy doesn't allow compensation beyond the refund for this order, and the full $87.55 has already been returned to your card. Account credits are only issued for late deliveries or specific missing or wrong items, and this order was never handed over, so neither applies.\n\nIf you'd like to speak with a human specialist about the app marking this as delivered, I can pass your case to them. They'll follow up within 24 hours, though I can't promise what they'll decide. Would you like me to do that?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Hmm, okay. I'm not thrilled that's the answer, since we're out the whole dinner and the app lied about it. But I guess the refund is what it is.\n\nYeah, go ahead and pass it along to someone. I'd like them to know the app marked it delivered when nothing showed up. Thanks for sorting the refund at least."
  },
  {
   "role": "tool",
   "name": "escalate_to_human",
   "args": {
    "customer_id": "D212",
    "reason": "customer_request",
    "order_id": "Q-8201",
    "summary": "Customer Grant Holloway (verified) requested a human specialist for order Q-8201 (Big Slice Pizza, $87.55). Courier picked up at 6:05 PM, reported vehicle breakdown at 6:40 PM, and the app auto-marked the order delivered at 6:52 PM with no handoff recorded. Full $87.55 refunded to Visa ending 4242 (RF-4000). Customer is unhappy that the app marked it delivered when nothing arrived, and that his family had no dinner. He asked for a credit for the trouble; this was declined under policy (no goodwill compensation). Customer wants the app's false delivery status noted."
   },
   "result": {
    "escalation_id": "ESC-700",
