  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I've passed your case to a human specialist (reference ESC-700). They'll follow up within 24 hours and will know that the app marked order Q-8201 as delivered at 6:52 PM even though the courier had reported a breakdown and no handoff was ever recorded.\n\nYour $87.55 refund is on its way to your Visa ending in 4242 and should arrive within 3 to 5 business days.\n\nI'm sorry about tonight's dinner, Grant. I hope your kids get fed soon."
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Appreciate that, and I'll keep an eye out for the refund. Thanks for passing it along. Let's hope the specialist gets the app sorted out. I'm going to go find the kids something better than cereal."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "You're welcome, Grant. I hope you find something good for the kids, and that the specialist gets the app's delivery status fixed. Have a good evening."
